[node name="FallingPixels" type="Node3D"]
editor_description = "Falling pixels (Tech): green, cyan and yellow cubes drop one after another onto a 2 x 2 grid square to the heading, land with a squash and stack, then blink out; 30 kept; the Clip times the drops. placeholder: life, max_marks and every particle number are the old wardrobe.json / trail script numbers until the designer sets them; the meshes are stand-ins until assets/19's (core/144 judges the look on stills)"
